[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-two-knights-exd5 4...cxd5"]
[Name "Two Knights: 4.exd5 cxd5 5.Bb5+"]

5. Bb5+ Nc6 { Blocks with a developing move: here the bishop has already left c8, so a knight does the job. }
6. h3 Bxf3 { Takes the knight. }
7. Qxf3 e6 { Guards d5. The position of 6.exd5 cxd5 7.Bb5+ Nc6. } *
